From 63df1bd3ca10006664510fc6870380d26a40f560 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:36:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(hud): preserve native Bedrock locator updates

Keep PlayerLocation compatibility translation and add the protocol 2193
LocatorBar packet, including groups, actions, optional fields, custom
textures, icon size, color, world position and actor position authority.
Expose complete group snapshots to native client integrations after join
and on late channel registration. Preserve groups across dimension changes.

Native 1.26.51.1 captures and controlled packet fixtures establish packet
341 and masks 1/2/4/8/16/32 for position, visibility, texture, size, color
and authority. Omitted dirty texture/color reset; position, size and
boolean fields require values. Actor bindings are supplied on Add, while
duplicate adds and updates for unknown groups are ignored. These rules
avoid copying mismatched constants from independent codecs.

Test signed actor IDs, wire boundaries, field merging, group lifecycle
and immutable snapshot round trips. Native rendering and route validation
remain separate work; decoding alone does not establish HUD parity.
